			"notes": "- Enhance English and Chinese language support for **command returns**.\n- Improve the syntax of **/cdp whitelist** to allow selection of existing vanilla items and mod items.\n- Add **/cdp help command** and **/cdp help parameter** to give in-game guidance on how to customize the settings and paramters.\n- Add a new, default insurance on **non-stackable items**. Now player's tools in backpack will not drop by default. Still, the non-stackable items might have durability damage after death."
